SY_TALK("0NnN6Hn-CKI",[[0,["Today we are going to worship Shri Krishna as Yogeshwara."]],[12,["As it is, you know that Vishnu’s first incarnation as a human being"]],[24,["was Vamana avatar."]],[28,["And then went till He came as Shri Ram."]],[39,["So, the past of Shri Krishna was Shri Ram."]],[45,["And when Shri Rama came on this earth,"]],[49,["He went into lots of austerities, to go to jungle,"]],[54,["His wife was lost, whom He had to find out."]],[58,["And to establish the benevolent king"]],[65,["on this earth, He was made the king of Ayodhya."]],[78,["But all His life it was a struggle","and austerities which He followed."]],[90,["As a result, the people who followed Shri Ram"]],[93,["became extremely austere."]],[96,["They used to sleep on the grass"]],[103,["because Shri Ram had to sleep on the grass for so many years."]],[108,["They used to wear wooden slippers."]],[113,["They would just wear very little clothes or one dhoti,"]],[120,["just like Shri Rama wore when His wife was out."]],[125,["All these austerities they did to show how a householder should be."]],[134,["He never enjoyed any other life as a man,"]],[142,["but just lived like an ascetic when His wife was lost."]],[153,["All these things were to establish also a very"]],[160,["ideal personality for a man to be attached to His wife."]],[168,["He was a person with Ekapatnivrata, means: one wife."]],[174,["Though She knew She was Mahalakshmi, She was a Goddess,"]],[180,["but still He was forced to do things"]],[191,["because He wanted to show how a benevolent king should be."]],[200,["In the second incarnation of His, when He came as Shri Krishna,"]],[207,["then He had to neutralize","all these austerities He has put on people."]],[299,["– Ha. So, Shri Krishna came on this earth."]],[308,["In His childhood He had to also face lots of"]],[314,["problems which He surpassed,"]],[320,["and He went and killed His uncle, as you know very well,"]],[328,["who was a rakshasa."]],[331,["After doing all this, then He went to Dwarika, which He built"]],[339,["– now they have found out where is Dwarika"]],[342,["– and He became the king of Dwarika."]],[351,["To understand Shri Krishna"]],[354,["in Sahaja Yoga is much more subtler","than the stories that they tell."]],[360,["[aside] … move it – better. ?"]],[366,["The stories are there,"]],[369,["but behind these stories,"]],[372,["as being Sahaja Yogis, you have to see the subtle things"]],[376,["about His incarnation."]],[380,["So, the first one was, He was Leeladhara,"]],[387,["means the One who said this is all a play."]],[391,["That means you have to become a witness."]],[395,["So, He said that your mind should become just a witness."]],[402,["At Virata stage He becomes Akbar."]],[406,["And at that stage He is the mind, the brain of"]],[415,["the great primordial Being."]],[419,["So, first He thinks that we have to become witness,"]],[428,["witness of the drama,"]],[430,["and we should not get lost into the Maya."]],[455,["If you are a witness you can see the Maya, how it works."]],[462,["So the first, first subtle nature","of Shri Krishna was to create a Leela"]],[472,["to neutralize all the austerities","created by the incarnation of Shri Rama."]],[479,["But the second great quality"]],[485,["that He had is also to put the Maya on people."]],[493,["So, if He is the brain, our brain should become a sakshi,"]],[500,["should become a witness, witness the play."]],[505,["You should not take anything as something extremely serious."]],[512,["When you look at things as sakshi swarupa, as"]],[516,["something that you are watching a drama,"]],[519,["you may for the time being feel that you are Napoleon,","you are the one who is acting."]],[525,["But after some time the play is over,"]],[527,["you know it’s a play. So, to reach that state, you have to"]],[534,["become thoughtlessly aware."]],[539,["Because we think from our brain,"]],[543,["and this brain goes on thinking, thinking, creating a Maya,"]],[548,["and playing into Maya."]],[551,["Now, here it is when you are a realized soul,","you should see through the Maya."]],[558,["Everything that I am doing or you are doing,"]],[566,["should be understood very well if you are really"]],[575,["the reflection of Shri Krishna’s brain."]],[581,["So, in your brain, there should be no worry,"]],[585,["there should be no stress, there should be no problem,"]],[591,["because you are just watching everything"]],[596,["in thoughtless awareness."]],[599,["So, when you are thoughtless awareness,"]],[602,["means when your brain is just in the state of witness,"]],[609,["you understand everything that is Divine."]],[614,["I’ll give you an example, just now it happened."]],[618,["I got into the car and they didn’t know where to go,"]],[623,["and we went onto wrong road, then I told him ” Go this way “."]],[628,["So he was wondering ” How Mother knows?” I said ” Vibrations! ”"]],[635,["Through vibrations I could feel we are ther","– they are all there, sitting there,"]],[639,["– and we came round."]],[643,["Unless and untill you are thoughtlessly aware,","you cannot grow, that is first thing."]],[649,["And secondly, unless and until you are thoughtlessly aware,","you do not know the absolute Truth."]],[658,["Through your brain only you will know."]],[662,["You don’t have to put your hands, you don’t have to ask questions."]],[667,["But it’s like a computer that works, it just gives you an answer."]],[673,["In that state you are completely one with the Divine,"]],[677,["and it just gives you an answer,"]],[681,["and you do that and you are amazed how it has worked out."]],[686,["Everything, every moment is computerized with Shri Krishna."]],[692,["But at the same time He tests you,"]],[697,["He plays His Leela on you. That one must know,"]],[702,["because He’s a diplomat."]],[704,["How He has played Leela on you is very interesting to see,"]],[710,["His style of Leela."]],[714,["Like He’s told Arjuna"]],[722,["that ” I will not fight “."]],[730,["Arjuna said: ” All right, what will you do? ”"]],[733,["” I’ll be your charioteer,"]],[737,["I’ll drive your chariot."]],[739,["” Now it would look funny to anybody: ”","What is this, such a great man"]],[744,["who calls me as His guru,"]],[746,["He says that He is the one who,"]],[748,["I mean, He says that I am the best of His disciples,"]],[752,["everything, and here He just offers","His services like a charioteer. ”"]],[760,["In this, He is just trying a trick on Arjuna."]],[772,["As if He knows the future that’s going to happen."]],[776,["So, the whole Gita was created because He was just a charioteer,"]],[783,["because Arjuna said ” I cannot fight my own people,"]],[789,["I cannot fight my own grandparents,","and I cannot fight my relations. ”"]],[798,["Now, if you say that Gita is for peace, it is not."]],[804,["It is not for peace."]],[807,["But He says that: ” They are already dead, whom are you killing?"]],[813,["These dead people, if you are killing them what will happen?"]],[818,["But if you now run away from the battlefield,"]],[823,["people will call you a coward,"]],[828,["and what will you get? But if you fight for the religion,"]],[834,["then you will get your resurrection – moksha.”"]],[842,["It’s a big trick in all these things."]],[845,["Same was said by Mohammed Sahib, and same by Christians later,"]],[851,["same about the Hindus","– that they all feel they are fighting for Dharma."]],[861,["In Arjuna’s case, it was a clear-cut case"]],[865,["that somebody was a rakshasa and horrible people,"]],[869,["they were adharmis, so He was fighting them, it’s all right."]],[876,["But what about other people when they say that ” We are going to"]],[882,["die for religion “? I met a Bosnia muslim","who had just somewhere escaped"]],[890,["and I asked Him ” Why, why do you want to fight?"]],[893,["Why do you want to fight for land","when you believe in the formless God? ”"]],[902,["He said: ” It’s written in the Koran that if you fight for religion"]],[906,["then you will get your moksha.","” Exactly the same Shri Krishna has said."]],[914,["But where is the mistake?"]],[918,["The mistake is: what is the Dharma?"]],[924,["Are you dharmic? Are you in – standing in Dharma?"]],[932,["Then this fight was in those days, were with weapons."]],[937,["So, why did Shri Krishna not take a weapon in His hand?"]],[943,["This is the second. Firstly, nobody has Dharma,"]],[948,["they’re all adharmis","– they may call themselves hindus, muslims, christians"]],[952,["– all are adharmis, they don’t follow the religion."]],[955,["And secondly, they are killing each other only,"]],[959,["one adharmi killing other adharmi,"]],[961,["or maybe in between themselves they are fighting: everybody"]],[965,["is thinking ” I am right and whatever I am doing is the right. ”"]],[970,["So, the first condition is put that for Dharma you have to fight."]],[974,["So first, one should find out: are we fighting for Dharma?"]],[981,["But He was even subtler,"]],[983,["He didn’t take any weapons in His hands, nothing."]],[987,["He was just holding the reins of the chariot."]],[993,["Because Shri Krishna is the mind,"]],[997,["is the Virat, is the great Mind,","He doesn’t need any weapons or such."]],[1004,["But what He did at that time,"]],[1006,["He used His mind for a very very profound knowledge,"]],[1014,["to explain to Arjuna. Imagine, in the warfield,"]],[1017,["He didn’t make Him sit down","” All right, you are my Shishya, you sit here,"]],[1021,["I am your guru, I’ll tell you. ”"]],[1024,["– nothing. In the battlefield you see,"]],[1027,["when everybody was there to fight","and they were about to start the war,"]],[1035,["He starts telling very patiently to Arjuna, at that time."]],[1045,["Now, what is He doing there? He’s not using any weapons, nothing."]],[1050,["He is being counselling, counselling to Arjuna, telling him."]],[1061,["Now, see His subtle brain."]],[1066,["He introduces in the first chapter only that"]],[1069,["” You have to go higher then what you are. ”"]],[1074,["And then He gives him"]],[1076,["the definition of a person who","is an enlightened person which is a Sthitha Pragya."]],[1084,["I mean, normally, a businessman will start"]],[1088,["from one dollar, then hundred dollars,","you see, the other way round."]],[1092,["But He told him first thing"]],[1095,["that ” You have to become a Sthitha Pragya, otherwise it’s no use.”"]],[1101,["Unless and until you become","Sthitha Pragya you cannot have Dharma,"]],[1106,["this is the point."]],[1108,["To understand Shri Krishna, you have to really have a very"]],[1111,["subtle brain, otherwise you cannot understand."]],[1115,["So, He tells that ” You should"]],[1120,["give up this kind of a morose that has developed in you,"]],[1125,["Kaivalya I will call it."]],[1128,["And what you have to do, now take up the weapon in your hand"]],[1133,["and fight. ”"]],[1139,["So, then, He asked him about other things,"]],[1146,["” What about that: You are here telling me"]],[1150,["that you should become Nishkriya,"]],[1153,["that means “no work”. Your karmas become akarmas."]],[1158,["Now, talking like this,"]],[1159,["and why do you want me to kill these people – that is akarma? ”"]],[1165,["Now, how you see, slowly removes from one point"]],[1169,["that you should fight for Dharma. Now, it’s a very subtle thing:"]],[1173,["are you in Dharma or not, first of all find out?"]],[1177,["You are not, so what Dharma you fight, first?"]],[1183,["Then, the second thing is karma."]],[1187,["Again, see, He is a brainy fellow, the brains of God,"]],[1194,["extremely tricky."]],[1197,["The second trick He plays on Him saying that"]],[1204,["” You are working, all right? But if you are a Sthitha Pragya,"]],[1215,["then you leave all the work at the lotus feet of God ” or Him."]],[1222,["[Hindi phrase, UNCLEAR]"]],[1225,["“Give up all Dharmas and follow Me. ”"]],[1230,["Now what is his Dharma?"]],[1233,["That problem is that people don’t understand Him."]],[1236,["It’s all concentrated on Shri Krishna, and"]],[1239,["His own manifestation."]],[1245,["[aside]"]],[1251,["He says that ” Do your karmas."]],[1255,["But you put them at the lotus feet of the Lord! ”"]],[1260,["– It’s not possible unless and until you are Sthitha Pragya,"]],[1264,["unless and until you are enlightened."]],[1267,["Now, when you are enlightened,","when you have got your realization,"]],[1271,["when you raise your Kundalini or anybody’s Kundalini,"]],[1275,["you don’t say ” Mother, I am giving realization “.","You don’t say that, never."]],[1282,["What you say: ” It is happening “, in third person you talk. ”"]],[1287,["It’s not coming, it’s not working or it’s just moving on the side."]],[1291,["This chakra is catching, that chakra is catching."]],[1294,["” You never say ” I am doing anything “, the ‘I’ is lost."]],[1300,["When that ‘I’ is lost, than only","you will put everything at the lotus feet of God."]],[1309,["So, first, it should be done in Dharma."]],[1312,["Supposing, somebody murders somebody and say ” Oh, I have"]],[1316,["done it now, so it is my karmas","and I put it at the lotus feet of Shri Krishna. ”"]],[1320,["Now, people can, I mean, people have special brains also"]],[1325,["to interprete Shri Krishna and Gita."]],[1329,["But what He said for Dharma you should do it."]],[1332,["So, first of all, you should be","a Sthitha Pragya, means an enlightened person,"]],[1338,["and whatever you do"]],[1340,["automatically goes at the lotus feet of God, automatically,"]],[1344,["spontaneously, Sahaj."]],[1350,["Now, the third thing He did:"]],[1353,["What about bhakti? People said ” What?"]],[1357,["We are doing bhakti to God, this,","that, then what is the reward for this? ”"]],[1362,["There again He plays tricks."]],[1365,["On one word He has made everybody dance, you know?"]],[1370,["He says ” You do bhakti, but it should be Ananya, ”"]],[1375,["– this is the word, Ananya, – when there is not the other,"]],[1380,["means when you have become One with Me,"]],[1384,["means you are a Sthitha Pragya, means you are a realized soul."]],[1391,["Just imagine, on this word if people pay attention,"]],[1396,["they will give up all this nonsense of bhakti"]],[1399,["and will first get their connection when they become Ananya"]],[1405,["and then do the bhakti."]],[1409,["Because Shri Krishna knew human beings very well."]],[1413,["I think, He knew them better than Christ","– definitely"]],[1418,["– because Christ was straightforward."]],[1421,["He said: ” Take out your right eye, throw it away."]],[1424,["Take out your left eye, throw it away."]],[1427,["Cut your hand, throw it away."]],[1429,["” Same with Mohammed Sahib. Who will do that?"]],[1434,["So, Shri Krishna was very clever, He said:"]],[1439,["straightforward they will not understand,"]],[1441,["so give them in such a way that they will go on doing and doing,"]],[1446,["we are doing so much bhakti, so many people come into it.","Even this Ram,"]],[1450,["Hari Ramas, they are developing now throat cancers."]],[1454,["So, they are saying ” Mother, why these throat cancer to us,"]],[1458,["we are saying the name of Sri Krishna?”","” Because you are not connected.”"]],[1464,["Now supposing, I will even want to","meet the president of this country."]],[1470,["I’ll have to go through such a protocol. I may not even meet."]],[1477,["But this One is the God of Gods."]],[1483,["He is the President of all the presidents."]],[1488,["If you have to take His name, if you go and take name of Lincoln,"]],[1493,["of Clinton, and go on saying","” Clinton, Clinton Clinton “, they’ll all arrest Me."]],[1499,["So, if you go on saying ” Rama, Rama, Rama,","Allah, Allah, Allah, Akbar, Akbar, Akbar “, you’ll be arrested."]],[1506,["You have no connection."]],[1510,["So, that Virata Shakti which we call,"]],[1514,["which is of course in Koran described as Akbar,"]],[1520,["this power also plays tricks."]],[1531,["As a Mother, I have to warn you"]],[1537,["that nothing will work out","unless (and) until you are a realized soul."]],[1545,["Nothing will work out. Now, for realization,"]],[1550,["He has said: ” You have to become “."]],[1553,["But He didn’t say at that time"]],[1557,["how you will become, what will work it out."]],[1563,["Because you see, sort of, if you go to college,"]],[1567,["all the knowledge is not given in first year."]],[1570,["Something is given, then something in second year,"]],[1573,["then in third year. Now in the seventh year,","now Sahaja Yoga has come"]],[1578,["to tell you everything, totally."]],[1582,["He is Totality, but He doesn’t give total knowledge."]],[1588,["The whole knowledge of Gita is nothing"]],[1591,["but trick that He has played with human beings who were stupid,"]],[1596,["and would never have understood Him"]],[1598,["if He’d told them about Sahaja Yoga."]],[1601,["Even today I meet many like that, of course,"]],[1604,["but so many He could not have got at that time."]],[1610,["So, they didn’t talk about Kundalini this much, so far,"]],[1616,["and that’s all."]],[1621,["Same with other people."]],[1624,["The kind of disciples they had, the kind of people they had,"]],[1629,["they could not tell them everything about"]],[1635,["their ascent, because they were not ready,"]],[1640,["they were not of that level, their brains were not that developed."]],[1645,["Now in this Kali Yuga, when I am starting this work,"]],[1648,["I find their brains are overdeveloped, over."]],[1654,["And so much so that overdeveloped brains become stupid"]],[1659,["and that’s really. Overuse of anything makes you stupid,"]],[1665,["and they become absolutely stupid."]],[1670,["Now, how can you tell them such a subtle knowledge"]],[1674,["who are stupid people? What is the way?"]],[1680,["If I talk like Shri Krishna"]],[1683,["it would have been just a waste of My energy"]],[1687,["and your energy. Half of you would have gone off to sleep."]],[1691,["So I said, first of all, let Me connect them to Divinity."]],[1696,["If I could connect them to Divinity – little bit even, little bit"]],[1701,["– then they will understand."]],[1703,["Because that will enlighten their brain a little bit,"]],[1707,["and they will know that there’s something more than what we know."]],[1711,["And that’s how it is going to work out."]],[1714,["So the subtle system of trickery of Shri Krishna"]],[1719,["has helped a lot, no doubt, that people are realizing"]],[1722,["that there is something missing in it. Even of Islam"]],[1729,["– Islam means surrender – but surrender to whom? To mullahs"]],[1736,["– or to whom? The problem started when","[Hijak, a name – UNCLEAR] he started like that."]],[1745,["There are mullahs and there are this."]],[1747,["So, the surrender part became"]],[1750,["surrender to these stupid mullahs.","I’ve seen most of them are absolutely stupid."]],[1756,["And they take a cane in their hands in the other, you see"]],[1760,["they beat, even women they beat."]],[1762,["You are supposed to do Pujas five times"]],[1765,["and if you don’t do them, Pujas five times,","they call it silla [UNCLEAR],"]],[1769,["then they beat women. Every shop must be closed five times."]],[1775,["I tell you, they are such hypocritical people naturally,"]],[1781,["because if you are asked to do five times meditation, say,"]],[1785,["you will never do it, but you will just do it out of fear."]],[1789,["Out of fear if you do something, what’s the use?"]],[1794,["Now, whatever Muhammed Sahib has said or Christ has said,"]],[1798,["it is only for angels, I can tell you, not for normal people."]],[1805,["And where are the angels? Very few there are:"]],[1811,["those are born-realized people who have come on this earth"]],[1815,["are angels. And they are told not to do something they will not do."]],[1823,["Most of them know what is right and wrong."]],[1827,["Where are those angels, very few?"]],[1831,["And those who are angels are treated just like, you can call it,"]],[1837,["like packed people or lunatic people, – nobody believes them."]],[1842,["One here and one there and one in some other place."]],[1847,["So this, what they preached was for the angels."]],[1853,["Only the angels could understand."]],[1856,["But Shri Krishna thought that these other people who are there,"]],[1860,["who are not angels, why not trick them?"]],[1864,["Many people come and tell me: ”","We take the name of Krishna every day like this,"]],[1870,["and we haven’t received anything."]],[1873,["” But first He said, ” You have to be Sthitha Pragya. ”"]],[1877,["Sthitha Pragya: ‘Sthitha’ means established,"]],[1883,["‘Pragya’ means enlightened,"]],[1887,["– you should be enlightened personality, absolutely established."]],[1894,["First thing, first thing you see, in a second chapter."]],[1898,["First thing is it. After that He says all these things,"]],[1903,["and that’s why many people have misunderstood Gita."]],[1910,["But His idea was: in one life they’ll misunderstand,"]],[1913,["second life they’ll misunderstand,"]],[1916,["third life they will start thinking ” After all, what is this?”"]],[1920,["First, He has said “You become a Sthitha Pragya”,","we have not become a Sthitha Pragya."]],[1925,["So, what’s wrong with us? ”"]],[1927,["So, some introspection will start."]],[1930,["That was His idea, idea I should say."]],[1934,["But I have seen people","who can give lectures on Gita hours together,"]],[1941,["but their brains are closed completely."]],[1947,["Now, to say that He didn’t say anything about Kundalini is there."]],[1952,["That’s why Gyaneshwara in","the twelvth century took permission from his brother"]],[1958,["who was his guru that ”Allow me, at least, to say about Kundalini.”"]],[1964,["And that is how it was exposed a little bit."]],[1968,["Of course, before that also,"]],[1971,["we have had people like Adi Shankaracharya, the sixth century,"]],[1977,["and before that also Markandeya."]],[1982,["But they talked about the Kundalini,","that’s all, praised the Kundalini."]],[1989,["But that She passes through six centers,","how will It raise and all that."]],[1995,["And not about the future, that this will happen one day."]],[2000,["So many have written, of course."]],[2002,["But I would say that precisely the one who has written"]],[2008,["complete description of Sahaja Yogis even is by Gyaneshwara"]],[2013,["in the poetry called Pasaydan in which","he exactly said what will happen,"]],[2021,["how many people will get realization"]],[2025,["and he said that ” You the people,"]],[2028,["who are the forests of the trees,","boon-giving trees, Kalpakaruna, boon-giving trees,"]],[2042,["you rise and give it to others."]],[2047,["” Then he says that ” You are the oceans who are"]],[2056,["giving ambrosia talks.”"]],[2060,["He has described you in such a beautiful manner"]],[2064,["that you should read the translation of Pasaydan"]],[2067,["and then you will know what you are,"]],[2070,["how you have been praised by him.","And he said that you will loose other relationship"]],[2076,["and the only relationships will be these."]],[2080,["They will be your real relations."]],[2083,["To say all these things, to have such a vision,"]],[2086,["he must be a great incarnation himself."]],[2090,["So, this is how in Gyaneshwari, which is a commentary of Gita,"]],[2101,["he has put in the sixth chapter, now is a commentary on Gita,"]],[2105,["but in the sixth chapter he said how you can get your realization."]],[2110,["About Kundalini, how it will work out."]],[2113,["So, gradually it was all unfolded."]],[2117,["And gradually people also developed"]],[2120,["their spiritual state to understand."]],[2123,["Supposing, I had started Sahaja Yoga even hundred years back,"]],[2127,["I would not have even one single disciple, one single Sahaja Yogi."]],[2132,["The reason was, the people were all right,","they were on value system, all right."]],[2136,["Their life was very much satisfying, they were very peaceful."]],[2140,["They were just interested in some horses or something like that."]],[2144,["But now, you find people are so much disturbed,"]],[2150,["so much in trouble, so much in chaos this in Kali Yuga,"]],[2154,["it’s the height of Kali Yuga now. So much of immorality,"]],[2159,["so much of dissatisfaction in life"]],[2163,["that they have to now think where to go."]],[2168,["Like a shock the future is waiting for them"]],[2172,["and now what should they achieve. So, the whole this"]],[2177,["Bhranti, illusion of life starts staring at them,"]],[2185,["and then they start thinking ” What is this, what am I doing,"]],[2189,["what have I done, why is it so?"]],[2192,["Why everything in a chaos, why is it happening? ”"]],[2196,["Then the seeking starts and with their seeking now,","you know what has happened,"]],[2201,["that you all have got your realization."]],[2204,["Without the seeking it would not","have been even possible for Me to talk to you"]],[2209,["at all about Sahaja Yoga."]],[2211,["It is because you are seekers I can talk to you."]],[2214,["And it has worked out,"]],[2216,["I am very happy that it has worked out in America."]],[2221,["Another quality, is a great quality of Shri Krishna, is that"]],[2226,["He is Gujara [HINDI ?], means"]],[2232,["His element is firmament, what we call Akash,"]],[2237,["and He penetrates into everything."]],[2241,["He penetrates into everything. He penetrates into the"]],[2250,["– what do you call that – anu, renu, paramanu,"]],[2256,["three things – atoms. Into little atoms it goes and it shakes them."]],[2266,["Now, if you ask any scientist, he’ll tell you"]],[2270,["that there is an asymetric, symetric vibrations even in atoms."]],[2277,["Now, how can this energy be existing there?"]],[2282,["Because He can penetrate into anything"]],[2285,["and because of this, He’s so penetrating,"]],[2289,["that He encompasses everything:"]],[2294,["into matter, into animals, into human beings, into realized souls"]],[2303,["He penetrates. In the matter it is just a vibrations,"]],[2310,["in the animals it is just a guiding force,"]],[2313,["it’s tremendous guiding force."]],[2321,["Like birds from Siberia flying down to Australia:"]],[2328,["who gives them the sense of direction?"]],[2331,["We never think about it."]],[2336,["There are so many things animals are doing."]],[2341,["They have such a sense of understanding."]],[2344,["Like a tiger in the, say, in the forest:"]],[2349,["all the animals know that there is a tiger in the forest,"]],[2352,["they are all quiet, respecting their king."]],[2356,["He kills, say one cow or could be some animal,"]],[2361,["they just respect him. The thing what he has killed is left"]],[2368,["for one day, nobody touches it."]],[2371,["See the protocol: now when he comes back next day,"]],[2376,["he eats to his own satisfaction,"]],[2379,["then the tigress, then the children, they eat."]],[2382,["Once they have finished with it,","then one by one, in the order of protocol,"]],[2389,["all the animals eat that animal,"]],[2393,["the last of all are crows"]],[2398,["which are perhaps vegetarians, I should say."]],[2403,["But the protocol is maintained."]],[2410,["If a lion is sitting,"]],[2416,["you can make it out there won’t be even a little sound anywhere."]],[2424,["So, it guides the animals and animals keep their character."]],[2431,["They are not like human beings."]],[2434,["For example, a snake is a snake and a tiger is a tiger."]],[2439,["But human beings can be snake, tiger, leopard"]],[2443,["– anything together."]],[2445,["They might be dogs, they might be","small little worms, they could be anything."]],[2452,["Combinations of so many things,"]],[2454,["because they have passed through","these Yonis, as they call them, these species."]],[2459,["So, all these kinds of combinations, permutations,","combinations inside of the past is existing."]],[2469,["And if somebody can take you to your subconscious,","I have seen this,"]],[2474,["people start barking like a dog,"]],[2477,["and sometimes they behave like tigers, this can happen."]],[2485,["All this is within us, the past,"]],[2488,["with all these complicated personalities."]],[2493,["Some are like owls, always very serious, you know, hawk-like,"]],[2501,["some are like chirping birds."]],[2504,["But there are so many combinations they have in them,"]],[2509,["that it is very difficult, you know,"]],[2513,["to make them little straightforward."]],[2519,["They are so much entangled. First to remove all the entanglement."]],[2525,["And then to raise the Kundalini."]],[2528,["The best part of the organization is, which is made,"]],[2533,["that consciousness is vertically placed."]],[2538,["Subconscious and Supraconscious sort."]],[2541,["Supraconscious righthandside of yours"]],[2544,["and the Subconscious lefthandside of yours."]],[2549,["And in the central the path is left on. This is the Sushumna path."]],[2554,["It is the Mahalakshmi’s path."]],[2556,["It is the path, which leads you to the state of Virat,"]],[2562,["to the state of your brain."]],[2567,["So now, the combination of three things work out."]],[2573,["The brain is the Virat, heart is Shiva,"]],[2579,["and the liver is Brahmadeva."]],[2585,["All these three powers are there."]],[2593,["But at that time, when you are realized,"]],[2596,["then your brain surrenders to Shiva,"]],[2601,["to the principle of Shiva, that is the Spirit."]],[2606,["Brain is surrendered, surrendered not by force or anything,"]],[2612,["but to absorb the power of the Spirit,"]],[2617,["the brain gets surrendered completely to the Spirit,"]],[2623,["so that the Spirit enlightens the brain."]],[2627,["It is the enlightenment of the brain"]],[2631,["that gives you all this subtle understanding."]],[2639,["It is to make your brain understand,"]],[2643,["there are so many blissful happenings, people are blessed:"]],[2649,["once, twice, thrice – then they are surprised,","the brain starts thinking."]],[2656,["”How did I get this blessing, how did it happen to me,"]],[2659,["how could I get my transformation?” So slowly-slowly"]],[2666,["they start trusting their heart,","means they start trusting their Spirit,"]],[2672,["they start trusting their devotion."]],[2679,["And this is how the bhakti is absolutely"]],[2686,["done without any desire, without any asking,"]],[2691,["without any obligation, just in oneness."]],[2695,["Because the brain joins hands with the heart, we can say."]],[2702,["Now, also the Brahmadeva becomes surrendered."]],[2710,["As a result, what happens:","that your liver is surrendered to your brain."]],[2719,["When this happens – when your liver is surrendered to your brain"]],[2726,["– whatever you do is all enlightened work."]],[2731,["Whatever you do: whether you sing,"]],[2735,["whether you’re a government servant, whether anything"]],[2738,["– whatever you do with your brain, anything"]],[2742,["through the Swadishthana"]],[2744,["or through the Brahmadeva, it is an enlightened work."]],[2762,["As it is the brain which is enlightened,"]],[2766,["which is connected with this All Pervading Power,"]],[2770,["whatever you are doing, whatever your ideas are,"]],[2776,["being absolutely enlightened means that you achieve them."]],[2787,["Enlightened brain, whatever it thinks,"]],[2791,["it is thinking as well as achieving – both together."]],[2797,["It’s a thing to be understood that an enlightened person"]],[2805,["has the power to achieve anything."]],[2812,["But at the same time his desires would be Divine."]],[2818,["Like the other day we had very few people say in Saritos,"]],[2823,["so all the Sahaja Yogis were extremely unhappy"]],[2828,["as if somebody has died in their family and worse than that."]],[2833,["Why? Because this was their own work,"]],[2839,["which they could not understand why this enlightened mind of theirs"]],[2846,["could not produce the result, achieve the results."]],[2852,["And they felt extremely unhappy."]],[2854,["This shows what identification there is for the spiritual work,"]],[2863,["or Divine work and their own lives."]],[2866,["To them this is the most important."]],[2869,["And everybody is not like that, of course."]],[2871,["For some people, something else is more important."]],[2875,["They may use Sahaja Yoga for their own well-being or anything."]],[2880,["But those who just think of Sahaja Yoga"]],[2884,["– that’s again the brain which is enlightened. They achieve it."]],[2889,["But it should not have any selfish motive behind it."]],[2893,["It should not have any hatred behind it or anything,"]],[2901,["or for some sort of a publicity or some."]],[2906,["But if it is just the thinking about the Sahaja Yoga work,"]],[2913,["it will be achieved, it will be achieved."]],[2916,["One should never feel frustrated."]],[2919,["That’s what is said, that God is with you,"]],[2922,["He is your shepherd."]],[2924,["And this is what happens when you become"]],[2929,["a surrendered lamb under the guide of this shepherd."]],[2940,["Then as a result of this brain becoming enlightened,","you start having faith in yourself."]],[2950,["Nirvikalpa, you become doubtlessly aware."]],[2953,["As soon as you become, I mean the brain becomes doubtless."]],[2957,["It’s the brain that thinks,","it’s the brain that doubts, it’s the brain"]],[2961,["that creates all conditionings, the brain that creates ego"]],[2966,["– one instrument doing all this nonsense. Hatred it will create,"]],[2971,["it will justify nonsense, it will criticize others,"]],[2978,["it will hate others, it will make fun of others."]],[2985,["That is not the quality of Shri Krishna,"]],[2989,["because He is the collective."]],[2995,["That’s why He never said: ” You are a sinner ”","or anything like that."]],[3002,["He didn’t criticize anyone."]],[3007,["After all, I have to criticize, He did not."]],[3012,["Now, if there was Kamsa, all right, kill him, finished."]],[3016,["There are Sanda, kill him."]],[3018,["Any rakshasa, Narakasura, kill him,"]],[3022,["finished, no argument., nothing.","”I have no time for this nonsense. Finish him.”"]],[3027,["Straightforward."]],[3030,["What is the use of criticizing anyone,"]],[3034,["just kill them. That was as straightforward."]],[3040,["But by killing them, they again come back in this Kali Yuga."]],[3047,["So the best thing is to detach people from him,"]],[3052,["from these rakshasas where they are lost."]],[3056,["That’s the best way. Now,","one way could be that I put it in your brains"]],[3063,["that this is a rakshas. But they won’t believe Me, they won’t."]],[3070,["So, what happens when you go to them,"]],[3073,["you get all the kinks in your head."]],[3078,["You start getting pins and needles on your fingertips."]],[3082,["This is all the activity of brain that it acts on your nerves,"]],[3087,["and you can feel it."]],[3089,["You start shaking. The other day somebody came and sat before","Me for news just doing like this. ” What is this – Stop it! ”"]],[3094,["” So I can’t, I can’t, I can’t “, he was going on.","I wasn’t doing anything to him, it’s the brain."]],[3101,["In My presence, the brain acts."]],[3106,["Because as I told you, He penetrates into anything,"]],[3110,["if I put my glance at somebody."]],[3114,["The other day,"]],[3115,["there was a boy, very naughty, beats people,","he bites them, these things like that, very crazy."]],[3121,["As soon as he saw Me ran away."]],[3124,["He attacks every person but he ran away."]],[3127,["Then you have seen people who are possessed, what happens to them?"]],[3131,["Just like this, they come to Me, they shake,"]],[3135,["they – sometimes I only worry that they should not faint"]],[3138,["in My presence in the programme, otherwise it’s a headache."]],[3143,["So, who acts in them, who acts on these people who are possessed,"]],[3149,["who makes all these gestures – is the brain."]],[3153,["In the brain they have got"]],[3157,["these problems and Shri Krishna makes them shake."]],[3162,["It’s the tremors that they feel,","the pins and needles that they feel,"]],[3167,["the heat that they feel – all this is central nervous system,"]],[3173,["run by brain."]],[3175,["So, after enlightenment, what happens that the brain is at peace,"]],[3185,["absolutely at peace with itself."]],[3189,["It doesn’t react as it used to react."]],[3194,["Like I’ve seen people here so speedy, so nervous,"]],[3200,["so upset all the time, so jittery, irritable."]],[3204,["I was reading the life of Mao and I was surprised:"]],[3207,["his physician, personal physician has said even."]],[3211,["Absolutely like a tyrant and he","used to keep up the faces very well."]],[3218,["But according to this doctor, he was a cruelest man he had known."]],[3225,["This is Mao,"]],[3228,["who obviously looked to be a very great reformer,","he did so much for that country, this thing."]],[3235,["But no, he was a hypocrite. How will you know"]],[3239,["somebody is a hypocrite or not – with your brain?"]],[3243,["Only if you are enlightened."]],[3246,["So, if Shri Krishna penetrates into your brain,"]],[3251,["then you become an enlightened person, Sthitha Pragya,"]],[3256,["and you become knowledgeable, you know everything,"]],[3263,["whatever is necessary."]],[3266,["You may not know who is number one Wimbledon, maybe."]],[3272,["You may not know who is the actress, what is her life, you may not."]],[3278,["You may not know who is the president","of such and such place, maybe."]],[3284,["But you will know whatever is necessary for you to know."]],[3291,["Otherwise people waste their energies."]],[3293,["I know of somebody who knew the telephone numbers"]],[3301,["and the car numbers of two thousand people. What is the need?"]],[3312,["Something like that,","all these stupid things is a waste of mental energy."]],[3321,["But a Sthitha Pragya does not, he is concentrated"]],[3325,["onto his own knowledge, onto the Divine understanding."]],[3340,["He works really like a computer, and such an efficient computer."]],[3353,["Today I just started talking about Kabira."]],[3357,["Immediately they said ”Mother, vibrations!”"]],[3362,["Taking the name of Kabira you get vibrations."]],[3368,["But to a normal person nothing, Kabira is nothing, another"]],[3373,["romantic fellow."]],[3376,["If they don’t want to understand something, they can say anything."]],[3383,["But only the people who are enlightened,"]],[3386,["their nervous system is so charged"]],[3392,["that they can feel what is wrong, what is right, they can feel"]],[3398,["the Divinity, they can make out"]],[3402,["who are incarnations and who were not."]],[3408,["You don’t know what has happened to","your nervous system: a new dimension has come."]],[3415,["Absolutely a new dimension in your nervous system has come,"]],[3420,["which is manifesting, and this is also","the blessings of Shri Krishna."]],[3428,["Because He is collectiveness within us,"]],[3433,["in the form of collectivity He works."]],[3446,["Unless and until this America is put right,"]],[3450,["Shri Krishna is not going to leave my throat, I tell you."]],[3458,["So, as America, I say, is the","place of Shri Krishna’s auspiciousness."]],[3472,["So, one has to understand what is Shri Krishna’s auspiciousness is."]],[3478,["They said He had 16.000 wives,"]],[3482,["these were His powers, 16.000 powers He has."]],[3488,["And to work out His incarnation He wanted them."]],[3492,["So, they came on this earth as princesses","and was married by a horrible"]],[3499,["king who married them and kept them in the jail."]],[3505,["So, He fought that king and got","them out of them and He married them."]],[3512,["It’s the best part of it: He married them. Because, you see,"]],[3519,["with a man, whatever may be his age,"]],[3522,["if he has 16.000 women around him,"]],[3526,["people will never understand that he is Yogeshwara."]],[3530,["Men have this problem. Not the women so much."]],[3535,["Because women become mothers, you see,","I’m a Mother, nobody can challenge my character."]],[3541,["Because I am a Mother. But the fatherhood can be challenged."]],[3547,["So He married them."]],[3549,["Then the essence of the five elements He married,"]],[3553,["as five wives."]],[3558,["But His real sense of morality is seen in the case of Draupadi."]],[3569,["You know the story of Mahabharata,"]],[3572,["when She was brought in the court of Duryodhana"]],[3578,["(who) asked Dushasana to take out Her saris."]],[3585,["At that time Tulsidas’s written what happened."]],[3590,["She was holding Her saree by Her teeth."]],[3597,["She called ” Krishna “, She could only say ” Kri “,"]],[3601,["‘shna’ means full stop, goes wrong."]],[3604,["She is holding on with only ‘Kri’, and wouldn’t say ‘shna’."]],[3608,["But as soon as She said ” Krishna “, the saree fell down."]],[3614,["Then He describes:"]],[3616,["“Dwarika yashoda jayo yashoda bhayo bari"]],[3619,["shankha chakra gada padma garuda laisi dhary.”"]],[3623,["[Unsure. In Shri Krishna Gitavali of Tulsidas ]"]],[3626,["What did He do?"]],[3627,["When She just said “Krishna”, there was a big sound in Dwarika,"]],[3635,["He was in Dwarika."]],[3640,["Immediately,"]],[3642,["with “shanka, chakra, gada, padma” – these are His four weapons"]],[3649,["– He came on the Garuda."]],[3652,["The way it is said is tremendous,","I mean, I feel really, it fulfils your heart with such"]],[3659,["understanding of Shri Krishna. For his own sister,"]],[3665,["He came all the way to save Her chastity."]],[3671,["To Him the chastity of His sister was of the greatest importance."]],[3677,["He could have said: ” No, no, no,"]],[3680,["I am a king, I have to look after this,","I have to do that, I have to ” – nothing."]],[3686,["If Her chastity is in danger,"]],[3688,["He came flying on the Garuda and supplied that."]],[3693,["And this fellow got tired"]],[3695,["pulling out Her saris. I think, he must have borrowed saris from Me"]],[3698,["because I have too many saris."]],[3702,["One after the other, one after the other,"]],[3705,["he made a pile of saris and he got tired."]],[3708,["He could not make Her nude."]],[3712,["The chastity of Draupadi was of such a height."]],[3718,["And how Shri Krishna tried to save it is remarkable."]],[3729,["So, this Yogeshwara Shri Krishna is also a Dhanvantari,"]],[3737,["means the doctor of doctors."]],[3742,["He is the One who cures. You see, because it’s all the brain"]],[3747,["– and the vibrations which flow on the nervous system."]],[3753,["So, He cures people through His brain."]],[3762,["Now, how? Say now, supposing somebody is having a problem, say"]],[3772,["on his heart. So as soon as he puts hands to My photograph,"]],[3781,["so immediately he gets problem on his left finger here."]],[3788,["The brain is working."]],[3791,["So in your brain, My vibrations go of Shri Krishna"]],[3800,["and they start sending these messages."]],[3806,["Because I am also Shri Krishna."]],[3808,["So this computer acts and immediately"]],[3811,["you know what’s wrong with that person is, he is a heart patient."]],[3818,["You don’t have to do any diagnosis, you don’t have to do anything."]],[3822,["Immediately you know. And who does this, it’s the"]],[3825,["principle of Shri Krishna in the brain of the Virat."]],[3830,["See this, also working for some people, I think."]],[3835,["Now you are convinced about it, you know that it"]],[3839,["works, it acts like this, it happens like that,"]],[3844,["and how it communicates through you."]],[3849,["So, this computer of Mine communicates."]],[3855,["Now, in a computer if you go,"]],[3857,["you can just press the button, of course they are all man-made,"]],[3860,["but whatever it is you then get the result."]],[3863,["Here it is not like that. It is the","brain automatically gives the result,"]],[3872,["immediately, through the other person."]],[3879,["And also the same brain tells you what is to be done"]],[3884,["to such and such person, how to work it out."]],[3888,["The same brain is emitting vibrations,"]],[3893,["and those vibrations are flowing through this brain,"]],[3900,["and they are the ones who tell you what’s wrong with this person."]],[3910,["So, all this work of penetration is done by Shri Krishna, no doubt."]],[3920,["He takes these vibrations, puts into another brain,"]],[3924,["and then that brain, that central nervous system starts working"]],[3928,["and then you get the result. But instantaneously,"]],[3933,["it’s not so much time it takes, another way I have described it,"]],[3937,["it just works immediately."]],[3939,["As soon as they put their hands before Me, immediately!"]],[3947,["So how important it is for us to look after our brain,","for Sahaja Yogis."]],[3956,["I don’t know in this America how far this brain is safe."]],[3962,["Because if you open any television, wah wah wah,"]],[3967,["you look outside on the street,"]],[3970,["look out for the – some advertisements"]],[3974,["and you hear this music"]],[3977,["– it breaks your brain completely."]],[3982,["Whole atmosphere is anti-Shri Krishna."]],[3991,["No purity of understanding, no sense of morality."]],[4000,["The way they make pictures, things, horrible violence, horrible,"]],[4007,["I should say, immoral scenes, all sorts of things"]],[4011,["– all created here in the land of Shri Krishna."]],[4016,["The One who through His waves can completely purify,"]],[4026,["because He’s Yogeshwara, because He is detached,"]],[4035,["absolutely detached, He cannot get attached to anything."]],[4041,["Only the brain makes you attached."]],[4044,["Now see, supposing this carpet is here."]],[4048,["This is a saree, is here."]],[4050,["I look at the saree, and what a nice is this one now."]],[4054,["Now, if it is mine, I’m worried it should not get spoiled"]],[4060,["and where it will be kept, what will happen to it."]],[4066,["Goes on worrying about things. Here is any"]],[4075,["more road you walk, there are","shops, shops, shops, shops, shops, shops, shops."]],[4081,["– Attention goes there, and in that attention"]],[4088,["this brain gets involved completely."]],[4092,["It gets involved, it wants this, and wants that,","and wants that, and wants that -for what?"]],[4102,["So, the detachment from the matter is only possible"]],[4108,["if you know generosity."]],[4113,["But many people are in Sahaja Yoga, but they are not."]],[4118,["What is generosity now?"]],[4122,["Generosity is now if you like My saree, you’ll have it."]],[4127,["That’s the real generosity."]],[4132,["Whatever I am buying is for you, supposing. So you have it."]],[4139,["If you have a generous detached temperament,"]],[4144,["then you can never get involved with matter."]],[4149,["And whatever you are involved, it is love."]],[4153,["Say, I went to Russia,"]],[4158,["and there was nice fish eggs they call as caviar."]],[4166,["There’s one doctor who likes it very much in London."]],[4170,["I said: ” Please, let Me have some “."]],[4173,["They said: ” Why do you want to take this one? ” ” I want to “."]],[4176,["They thought of the doctor who needed it there"]],[4179,["who likes it very much and I felt very happy about that."]],[4182,["And the doctor also was very happy:"]],[4185,["” Mother, you remember even such small thing like this?"]],[4191,["So, the matter has a sense of giving","very great joy to another person."]],[4200,["If you do it with love, again, I say: ” Do it with love “,"]],[4204,["not with attachment, but with love which is detached."]],[4213,["He’s the One who is detached."]],[4222,["So, what is the love that is detached, I’ve told many a times:"]],[4230,["Like the sap in the tree rises, goes to every part of the tree"]],[4238,["and is not attached to any part."]],[4242,["And if it gets attached,"]],[4246,["then the tree will die, and that fruit,","whatever it is, will die also."]],[4252,["So, what is it a detached love is?"]],[4256,["Detached love is the most beautiful thing."]],[4261,["Firstly, by detached love you know what to give to whom,"]],[4268,["what will make people happy, what will make them joyous,"]],[4274,["what do they like."]],[4276,["– In love only you know these things, – what do they like,"]],[4280,["what is their colour, style, what they want. Little, little things."]],[4290,["As I told you yesterday the story of Shri Rama,"]],[4295,["whatever is done with love, even a little thing that you know"]],[4303,["you would like, I would like to purchase, may look stupid."]],[4307,["But I know you like it, so I’ll buy that."]],[4312,["In the same way, you also do that."]],[4315,["All the time you think ” Mother, what will She like?”"]],[4319,["So, you look for little things here and there."]],[4325,["But this detachment has to be full and complete."]],[4330,["Then only you really get people attached to you,","otherwise you cannot."]],[4336,["If you are not detached, you cannot get"]],[4341,["that complete love for another person."]],[4344,["Because if you are doing something, say, for money,"]],[4350,["or if you are doing something for lust,"]],[4354,["or for greed, or for some sort of a position, it has no meaning."]],[4361,["People know","”Oh, I know why he is doing it, because I am such and such“."]],[4367,["In Sahaja Yoga also many people come either to make money,"]],[4372,["either to get cured, all kinds of things."]],[4377,["But if you are detached,"]],[4382,["then only Sahaja Yoga will spread."]],[4387,["As long as there are attachments,","you should know that you are not yet a Sahaja Yogi."]],[4393,["I am not saying ”You take out your eye or cut your hands”","I didn’t say that, to that extent."]],[4401,["What I’m saying: you should introspect and see:"]],[4405,["”How much am I attached to this or to that,"]],[4409,["and why am I so much attached, what does it matter?”"]],[4415,["Always, as a result of attachment"]],[4417,["you’ll always find disappointments."]],[4420,["I’ve seen parents who have doted on","their child, loved their child, this, that."]],[4425,["Children mostly go astray."]],[4432,["But if you have a detached love for your child,"]],[4436,["you do nice things for the child."]],[4440,["At the same time, you know when to say ‘no’,","when it is not good. ” This I don’t like, don’t do it “,"]],[4447,["you must say that."]],[4453,["But detachment is even wider than that."]],[4458,["Like some people are very fond of food."]],[4464,["So,"]],[4467,["to say that you be detached from food is very difficult for them."]],[4471,["Specially, at a certain age, I think, they are very fond of good"]],[4476,["food and all that. Gandhiji has talked about Aswad:"]],[4482,["you should not have any taste."]],[4484,["But as you grow in Sahaja Yoga,","you’ll find automatically it will happen."]],[4491,["All your fascination about food will drop out."]],[4495,["That is another sign that you are absolutely detached about food."]],[4500,["Now, today I had My lunch,","I don’t know whether it is dinner or lunch,"]],[4505,["’cause I had it at about five o’clock,"]],[4507,["so I don’t know wich part of the day it is."]],[4511,["And if I don’t eat, it also makes no difference to Me,"]],[4516,["it doesn’t make Me weak or in any way unhappy."]],[4522,["But thinking about food is just spoiling your brain."]],[4529,["Many people just think about food."]],[4531,["We went to their house: ” Oh, they had made such nice things."]],[4535,["“We went to this house ” They’ve made such nice things.”"]],[4538,["What’s the use? You already have eaten, finished, now, done."]],[4542,["Now, why are you thinking about that?"]],[4545,["Or: ” I went to somebody’s house,","they had given me a horrible food."]],[4550,["” Why to think of food, I still don’t understand."]],[4554,["Whatever has happened has happened."]],[4557,["By thinking you cannot get back what you have been eating,"]],[4561,["or what you are going to eat."]],[4563,["It’s there, whatever is there you have to eat, you see,","what can you do?"]],[4567,["For example, today, they asked Me:","”Mother, will you have hot dog?\""]],[4572,["In Hindi language it means real hot dog – means:"]],[4576,["garam kupte – they call that."]],[4581,["I said ” All right, I’ll have it “."]],[4584,["They said ” All the Americans eat. ”","” All right, I am an american, give Me “."]],[4590,["But when you know something will not","do good for your teeth or something, you should not eat."]],[4596,["For example, the beef is very bad for the teeth, very bad."]],[4600,["That’s why you people loose your teeth very fast."]],[4603,["Many people ask Me in the interview ”","Are your denture your own? ” I said: ” Of course, Mine “."]],[4609,["They can’t believe it’s Mine."]],[4612,["Because I know what not to eat for the teeth’s sake."]],[4618,["But one should not be attached to an idea,"]],[4622,["that’s even subtler attachments."]],[4624,["That has really killed this world with so many problems of"]],[4628,["fanaticism, racialism, I don’t know what."]],[4633,["Now, here, see the contradictions people have:"]],[4636,["they go to the sea to get darker, and they have racialism."]],[4642,["Why do you go to the sea?"]],[4644,["If you go to become darker,"]],[4647,["then why do you hate the people who are dark?"]],[4651,["Such a contradiction because the brain is not in balance."]],[4656,["And for that you have racialism,"]],[4662,["you become racist."]],[4664,["If not that, you have another conditioning that"]],[4669,["there are different casts and according to the cast,","you should go, in India."]],[4675,["How can there be any cast when everybody","has the Spirit in their heart."]],[4681,["They won’t eat from another lower cast,","they are higher cast, this, that."]],[4687,["This brain is the one which creates all kinds of conditionings,"]],[4692,["and all those great Saints who have lived on this earth,"]],[4696,["wether they were in India or abroad or anywhere,"]],[4699,["all of them have stood against this nonsense of discrimination."]],[4704,["That comes from brain, you know, ask them"]],[4708,["” Why do you think like that, you are higher than others? ”"]],[4712,["Like the germans think they are the highest race."]],[4715,["Now, who will believe that bull story, I don’t know?"]],[4718,["It is absolutely nonsensical story:"]],[4720,["germans, the ones who have killed children in the gas chamber"]],[4725,["and enjoyed that, they must be the lowest race ever going!"]],[4733,["But they think they are the highest race! How can they be?"]],[4738,["Tomorrow, Rwanda people will say: ” We are the highest race,"]],[4741,["because we can kill each other nicely in the open. ”"]],[4748,["So, to think yourself to be higher than others,"]],[4752,["to think that you’re more beautiful than others, others are ugly"]],[4758,["– all this is the brain which takes you to ego,"]],[4766,["and the ego is the one who befools you completely all the time."]],[4772,["That’s the job of Shri Krishna."]],[4775,["The story you must have heard about Narada"]],[4778,["who never wanted to see, who thought he was a great man"]],[4782,["because he was never attracted to a woman,","and he was challenging even Shiva."]],[4788,["Then Shri Krishna played a trick on him, He always plays tricks."]],[4793,["He sent two Gandharvas to tease him."]],[4799,["They went down and they asked Narada. They said"]],[4802,["” You are such a beautiful man, such a handsome person,"]],[4806,["there is a marriage going on of a lady [Rupoghadi, UNCLEAR]"]],[4809,["she is very beautiful, she is a princess"]],[4812,["and why don’t you go there, she’ll definitely marry you."]],[4815,["” And they pampered his ego, you see,","such a lot, he started floating in the air."]],[4820,["And he said ”All right, I am going to go there, I am so handsome.”"]],[4825,["Ego. He went there, and this princess came out with a garland."]],[4832,["She looked at him and she giggled first and then she laughed aloud"]],[4836,["and then she went away."]],[4839,["He couldn’t understand, looked at these two persons,"]],[4842,["they said ”It’s all right, now, it doesn’t matter,","maybe somebody is better looking, then you.”"]],[4848,["So, Narada was very angry, he went to the lake."]],[4853,["When he looked into the lake, his face was like a monkey."]],[4859,["He’s become a monkey because this ego makes you a monkey."]],[4865,["And you start thinking: ah, you are great,","you are very beautiful, you are this thing, that thing…"]],[4870,["But you are not."]],[4873,["Because if you are, you won’t think."]],[4877,["Whatever you are, you don’t think about it. You don’t think:","”I am a human being“, do you say that?"]],[4884,["Or do you say ” I have no tails “, do you boast of that?"]],[4888,["Whatever you are not, then you boast: ” I am very beautiful,"]],[4892,["I am very good looking, others are ugly, this thing “."]],[4895,["Then Shri Krishna plays a part through the Maya,"]],[4901,["and He gives a big lesson to that person."]],[4907,["It happens."]],[4909,["So, never think that you are something great,"]],[4913,["or you have achieved this in life and achieved that in life,"]],[4919,["and that you are something a big Johnny."]],[4924,["Nothing, it’s nothing but the ego that has moved on here"]],[4931,["and giving you these ideas, from the ego."]],[4935,["And if you go even further with it,"]],[4938,["then Hitler may enter into your ego and you might behave like him."]],[4945,["Or if you are conditioned, impossible to tell you anything."]],[4951,["Like this Hari Rama fellow I told you","”Why do you wear dhoti in this cold weather?”"]],[4956,["He said ” My guru has told me to wear dhoti “."]],[4959,["”So what sort of a guru is it,"]],[4961,["that he makes you feel cold. I mean, I am a Mother,"]],[4964,["I don’t like all this nonsense.”"]],[4966,["He said ” No, but my guru has said “."]],[4969,["What a conditioning! And conditioning"]],[4973,["for something which is absolutely absurd and ridiculous."]],[4979,["Now see, Americans are most vulnerable to such a thing."]],[4985,["You start any nonsense,"]],[4987,["immediately the Americans are the first to jump on it, immediately."]],[4991,["Drugs you start, you start some sort of a,"]],[4998,["I can say, fancy dress."]],[5002,["It will start in Paris but will be sold in America."]],[5007,["Immediately. There are on the look-out of something new."]],[5011,["It might be a monkey trick, but they will do it."]],[5015,["I don’t know why Americans who are the residents of"]],[5021,["Shri Krishna’s land have no discretion at all,"]],[5028,["what to accept, what not to accept."]],[5031,["They are the worst, they are worse than children even,"]],[5035,["there is no maturity of any kind: ” What’s wrong? ”"]],[5043,["So, the discretion which is the center we have here of Hamsa"]],[5049,["which is ruled by Vishuddhi, is completely sometimes blocked."]],[5058,["Like one lady who came to America told Me very boastfully: ”"]],[5065,["Have you been to the pubs in England? ” I said ” No."]],[5069,["Why? ” ” Oh, my God, what pubs you have here! You know,"]],[5075,["I went to the best ” I said ” Which one? ”"]],[5078,["“It’s known as Hermit’s pub ”"]],[5081,["” What is so special? ” Very high class lady, very high class"]],[5087,["– she says: ” You see, one man died,"]],[5090,["for one month nobody lifted the body,"]],[5092,["the whole thing was filled with the stink."]],[5096,["So the stink is preserved"]],[5098,["and even the cowwebs are preserved as they are there."]],[5101,["Such a great thing was this: in,"]],[5104,["when I went, and really I felt so spiritual there?"]],[5113,["” Then she started boasting ” You see, we are free people."]],[5116,["I allow my children to drink. I give them drinks."]],[5123,["” I said: ” Really? ” ” Yeah, I can give them any alcohol, anyone."]],[5128,["I do not say ‘not this, not that’ – no, they can have “."]],[5132,["The children who were hardly twelve and forteen years of age."]],[5137,["I said ” All right, if you have been doing that,"]],[5142,["what can I say? You are a great lady,"]],[5144,["I would not do to my children or to my grandchildren,","but you are great, namaskar “."]],[5151,["After three, four months, we heard"]],[5153,["that there was a birthday party of the younger boy"]],[5157,["and she had given all these alcohols to them for the friends."]],[5163,["God knows what happened – they had candles and this and that"]],[5166,["– the whole house got burnt and all the children, her sons"]],[5173,["and these two sleeping upstairs, all got burnt and died."]],[5183,["Boasting about nonsense,"]],[5186,["like: ” I have had five hundred men with me “."]],[5192,["Another will say: ” I have so many women. ”"]],[5195,["I mean, you are stupid fools because you are organizing"]],[5202,["nice way to go to hell, and you are all going to go to hell,"]],[5207,["this is what it is to be told to them. If you go on like this,"]],[5212,["what will happen to you?"]],[5214,["Accumulating everything that will destroy them,"]],[5218,["doing everything that will destroy.","” Oh that’s good!” I said ” Why? ”"]],[5223,["” You know, if you take that, then in two minutes you go off. ”"]],[5230,["I said: ” To where? To hell, or where? “."]],[5234,["Anything that is destructive,","I don’t know why the Americans should accept it,"]],[5240,["when they have Shri Krisna as their Lord."]],[5247,["It is to be understood by Sahaja Yogis also,"]],[5250,["that you have to really transform","you have to serve to such an extent"]],[5255,["that what it is, whatever is destructive should be given up."]],[5262,["First of all,"]],[5264,["I find some men and ladies with such long faces, you know."]],[5270,["How can you be? You are living in the country of Leeladhara."]],[5276,["He is the One who made everybody dance,"]],[5279,["and He is the One who sprayed Ras, Ra is energy, Dha is with"]],[5285,["– Ra-Dha. Ra is energy, the One who sustains energy."]],[5290,["The One who did the mental energy enlightened and to sustain it,"]],[5297,["how can you people take to adharma,"]],[5302,["to immorality, and to destruction, I just can’t understand."]],[5312,["I don’t know what are His plans are, very well,"]],[5317,["but He has to really save people of America from"]],[5322,["all kinds of nonsense they do morning till evening."]],[5328,["There’s nobody who is sensible in the politics,"]],[5332,["nobody who has a good character at a very high positions,"]],[5338,["what sort of things! You cannot get one man"]],[5342,["whom you can say he is all right","and he will do good to your nation."]],[5349,["Criticizing others, they are very good."]],[5352,["Like we had this plague, this thing not much"]],[5355,["– this little bit came out,","they have published it all over these media,"]],[5361,["they’ve stopped all our ships,","stopped all our aeroplanes, made such a fuss,"]],[5366,["put us into so much trouble – what about your AIDS,"]],[5369,["which you are giving Prasad everywhere."]],[5375,["It’s very surprising that with your brain","enlightened by Shri Krishna,"]],[5382,["how could people accept even mentally"]],[5386,["– person like Freud. How could you accept Freud?"]],[5391,["I just can’t understand."]],[5394,["And now you are all ruined. So, now we are worried."]],[5398,["They don’t what to do. Now they are breaking families,"]],[5400,["and all the logical conclusions","they reach is just the opposite of Shri Krishna."]],[5406,["Like this Simpson killed his wife."]],[5408,["All right, he killed, finished, this Simpson business."]],[5411,["Now they are coming out big theories, see now: why psychologically"]],[5416,["he killed, because he was married to her."]],[5419,["When you marry only you kill your wife or your husband."]],[5422,["– So, you should not marry: what a conclusion!"]],[5426,["Tomorrow they’ll say that people are killing each other,"]],[5430,["so allow them to have weapons in their hand."]],[5433,["Now, they want to allow them to have some drugs also."]],[5438,["Allow them to have homosexuality, allow them to have all this."]],[5443,["Because, I think, these people in charge of affairs"]],[5448,["do not want anybody to live,"]],[5452,["think that ” Let them fight among themselves, do what they like,"]],[5455,["we should have our own seats. ”"]],[5457,["The way they are not worried about the immorality"]],[5461,["and all the destructive forces","that are acting on American children,"]],[5469,["american youth and american people, not bothered about them."]],[5477,["So, tonight we are praising Shri Krishna who is Yogeshwara."]],[5491,["He eats but He does not eat. He sleeps but He does not sleep."]],[5498,["He has wives but He has no wife. Like this is the Yogeshwara,"]],[5507,["and that is what you are Yogis, and He is your Ishwara,"]],[5511,["so, you have to try to be like Him."]],[5514,["Let your brain be enlightened by His blessings."]],[5519,["And you’ll become that great personality","that encompasses everything,"]],[5525,["that sees everything, that gives you discretion,"]],[5529,["that makes you understand what’s wrong."]],[5531,["And you feel enthousiastic about changing this America"]],[5538,["with all your efforts, with all the mind."]],[5542,["That’s the most important thing you have to do."]],[5545,["As it is, He is a Kubera, He is the Lord of Wealth"]],[5553,["and He has given you such a lot of"]],[5556,["wealth all around, you see, just very near"]],[5559,["New York, you should have such a beautiful places."]],[5562,["In every way, you are blessed: you have money,"]],[5566,["you have everything, you have brains."]],[5569,["Everything is there. What is lacking is wisdom,"]],[5575,["with everything, with you. Supposing,"]],[5578,["you have a car."]],[5582,["You’re having a car, you have got keys,","you have got engine, you have brake,"]],[5588,["everything, but you don’t know how to drive, so what will happen?"]],[5596,["This is what it is."]],[5598,["So, as Sahaja Yogis from America,","you have a very, very, very special responsibility,"]],[5606,["very special responsibility."]],[5609,["Today we’ll be saying His hundred","and eight names which are well-done,"]],[5615,["have come from Poona all the way."]],[5618,["So that we’ll have it first and then a little Puja of the Devi."]],[5625,["May God bless you!"]]]);
